---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import PhoneApp from "../islands/PhoneApp";
---

<Base title="DTMF Web Dialer">
  <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-dvh max-w-md flex-col px-4 pb-6 pt-6">
    <header class="mb-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-zinc-400 uppercase">DTMF</p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">Web Dialer</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        番号をためて、キーを離すとトーンが鳴ります
      </p>
      <p
        id="audio-unsupported"
        class="mt-4 hidden rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-200"
        role="alert"
      >
        お使いのブラウザは Web Audio API に対応していません。
      </p>
    </header>
    <main class="flex-1">
      <PhoneApp client:only="solid-js" />
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Base>
